</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-2e66" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-gjNHFA iojfsv pf-43_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC"><div class="sc-pVTFL cZzoXH pf-44_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hjGZqJ dfjDDX pf-45_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-TBWPX gKJFzi pf-46_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bUbRBg Gdkwx pf-48_">It’s Called <a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank">ThePhotoStick Omni</a>, and It’s Already Helped Thousands Keep Their Devices Clear, and Their Memories Protected!&nbsp;</span></h2><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-dtMgUX dcJVgJ pf-49_ pf-image-1"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-1ec5da52--Omni-SetHands-Holding.jpg?v=1629144734" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-1ec5da52--Omni-SetHands-Holding.jpg?v=1629144734 1536w" width="1705" height="1011"/></a><p class="sc-dwsnSq jqylDz pf-50_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bUbRBg Gdkwx pf-52_"><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" style="font-weight: bold;">The Photostick Omni</a> is a <span style="font-weight: bold;">tiny memory stick that fits in the palm of your hand</span>.<br><br>Using a <span style="font-weight: bold;">special adaptor piece</span>, it fits practically any type of device – Apple, Samsung, you name it. Just plug it in, and in seconds, it <span style="font-weight: bold;">automatically backs up ALL of your photos and videos</span> onto the memory stick.<br><br>Once the files are saved to <a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" style="font-weight: bold;">ThePhotostick Omni</a>, you can safely delete them